{"sha": "670df2f427f47504adf0aefa29a06a5844a4f1208177d0338e95cafb160c1d9c", "body": ["\\textbf{14.} 当 $z = \\frac12$ 时：$1 = \\sin\\frac\\pi2 =", "\\frac\\pi2\\prod_{n\\geq1}\\bigl(1 - \\frac1{4n^2}\\bigr) =", "\\frac\\pi2\\prod\\frac{4n^2-1}{4n^2}$，则", "\\[", "\\frac\\pi2 = \\prod_{n\\geq1}\\frac{4n^2}{4n^2 - 1}", "= \\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\prod_{n=1}^N", "\\frac{(2n)(2n)}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}", "= \\lim_{N\\to\\infty}", "\\frac{2\\cdot2\\cdot4\\cdot4\\cdots(2N)(2N)}", "{1\\cdot3\\cdot3\\cdot5\\cdots(2N-1)(2N+1)} :", "\\]", "沃利斯乘积，是欧拉因式分解", "的一个直接推论。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 对 $\\abs z \\leq r < 1$，每个因子都落在", "$D(1, r^2) \\subseteq D(1, 1)$，故 $P(z)/z = \\exp\\bigl(", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\log(1 - z^2/n^2)\\bigr)$：每个部分积", "恰为某个部分和的指数，两边同时", "取极限（由 $\\exp$ 的连续性）。双重级数", "\\[", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\log\\Bigl(1 - \\frac{z^2}{n^2}\\Bigr)", "= -\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\sum_{k\\geq1}\\frac{z^{2k}}{k\\,n^{2k}}", "= -\\sum_{k\\geq1}\\frac{\\zeta(2k)}k\\,z^{2k}", "= -\\zeta(2)\\,z^2 + O(z^4)", "\\]", "由级数的 Fubini 定理重排：$\\sum_{n,k}", "\\frac{r^{2k}}{kn^{2k}} \\leq \\sum_k\\zeta(2k)r^{2k} \\leq", "\\zeta(2)\\frac{r^2}{1-r^2} < \\infty$。由此", "\\[", "P(z) = z\\,\\exp\\bigl(-\\zeta(2)z^2 + O(z^4)\\bigr)", "= z - \\zeta(2)\\,z^3 + O(z^5) ,", "\\]", "而练习 13 将其与 $\\sin(\\pi z) = \\pi z -", "\\frac{\\pi^3}6z^3 + O(z^5)$：$\\pi\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^3}6$，", "即 $\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$。加法形式", "（练习 10）与乘积形式", "算出的是同一个数。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 在紧集 $K \\subseteq \\C\\setminus\\Z$ 上，", "部分和 $S_N = \\frac1z + \\sum_{n\\leq N}\\bigl(", "\\frac1{z-n} + \\frac1{z+n}\\bigr)$（练习 9，各项", "重组为 $\\frac{2z}{z^2-n^2} = \\frac1{z-n} +", "\\frac1{z+n}$）一致收敛到 $\\pi\\cot(\\pi z)$，故", "由\\cref{thm:b3:holomorphic:weierstrassconv}可知 $S_N' \\to", "(\\pi\\cot\\pi z)' = -\\pi^2/\\sin^2(\\pi z)$，在 $K$ 上一致收敛。", "由于 $S_N' = -\\sum_{\\abs n\\leq N}(z - n)^{-2}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi^2}{\\sin^2(\\pi z)} =", "\\sum_{n\\in\\Z}\\frac1{(z - n)^2} ,", "\\]", "该级数在 $\\C\\setminus\\Z$ 的紧子集上正规收敛", "（通项 $O(n^{-2})$）。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 当 $z = \\frac12$ 时，左边为 $\\pi^2$；", "右边，$(\\frac12 - n)^2 = \\frac{(2n-1)^2}4$，其中 $2n -", "1$ 恰好遍历全体奇整数一次，当 $n$", "遍历 $\\Z$ 时：", "\\[", "\\pi^2 = \\sum_{n\\in\\Z}\\frac{4}{(2n-1)^2}", "= 8\\sum_{m\\geq0}\\frac1{(2m+1)^2},", "\\qquad", "\\sum_{m\\geq0}\\frac1{(2m+1)^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}8 .", "\\]", "按奇偶性拆分：$\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}8 +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{(2n)^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}8 +", "\\frac{\\zeta(2)}4$，故 $\\frac34\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}8$ 且", "$\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$ 再次成立。", "", "\\textbf{18.} 记 $c = \\cot\\theta$，且 $\\cot(2\\theta) =", "\\frac{c^2-1}{2c}$：$\\cot\\theta - 2\\cot(2\\theta) = c -", "\\frac{c^2-1}c = \\frac1c = \\tan\\theta$。由此 $\\pi\\tan(\\pi z)", "= \\pi\\cot(\\pi z) - 2\\pi\\cot(2\\pi z)$，并由练习 9 在 $z$", "与 $2z$ 处的结论，可得", "\\[", "\\pi\\cot(\\pi z) = \\frac1z +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{2z}{z^2 - n^2},", "\\qquad", "2\\pi\\cot(2\\pi z) = \\frac1z +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{8z}{4z^2 - n^2} .", "\\]", "两个级数在每个非极点的固定 $z$ 处绝对收敛，", "故其差可任意重新组合：在", "第二个级数中，偶数项 $n = 2m$ 给出 $\\frac{8z}{4z^2 -", "4m^2} = \\frac{2z}{z^2 - m^2}$，与第一个级数", "全部抵消，剩下", "\\[", "\\pi\\tan(\\pi z) = -\\sum_{m\\geq0}\\frac{8z}{4z^2 - (2m+1)^2}", "= \\sum_{m\\geq0}\\frac{8z}{(2m+1)^2 - 4z^2} ,", "\\]", "在避开 $\\frac12 + \\Z$ 的紧集上正规收敛（通项", "$O(m^{-2})$）。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 对 $\\abs z \\leq r < \\frac12$：", "\\[", "\\frac{8z}{(2m+1)^2 - 4z^2} = \\frac{8z}{(2m+1)^2}", "\\sum_{k\\geq0}\\Bigl(\\frac{4z^2}{(2m+1)^2}\\Bigr)^{k},", "\\]", "其中 $\\sum_{m,k}8r\\,(4r^2)^k(2m+1)^{-2k-2} < \\infty$，因为", "$4r^2 < 1$。由 Fubini 定理，将二重和重排为", "\\[", "\\pi\\tan(\\pi z) =", "\\sum_{k\\geq0}8\\cdot4^k\\,\\lambda(2k+2)\\,z^{2k+1} .", "\\]", "比较 $\\pi\\tan(\\pi z) = \\pi^2z + \\frac{\\pi^4}3z^3 +", "O(z^5)$：$z$ 的系数给出 $8\\lambda(2) = \\pi^2$", "--- 再次用到练习 17 --- 而 $z^3$ 的系数给出", "$32\\lambda(4) = \\frac{\\pi^4}3$，即 $\\lambda(4) =", "\\frac{\\pi^4}{96}$。去掉偶数分母后，", "$\\lambda(4) = \\zeta(4) - 2^{-4}\\zeta(4) =", "\\frac{15}{16}\\zeta(4)$：$\\zeta(4) = \\frac{16}{15}\\cdot", "\\frac{\\pi^4}{96} = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90}$，与练习 7 一致。", ""]}